# Validation on request only

Do **not** run the full validation workflow (pentest, `validate-changes.md`, live header probes) on every edit or push.

Run it **only** when the user:

- Types a slash command: `/validate`, `/pentest`, or `/standards` (see `.cursor/commands/`)
- Or explicitly asks in chat (validate, pentest, security review, coding standards check)

When triggered, follow [.cursor/prompts/validate-changes.md](../prompts/validate-changes.md).

Routine work: lint/type-check/build only if needed for the task — not the full checklist unless requested.
